1161	 * and each lane's own service-worker version and cache identity, which name
1162	 * hashed bundles that cannot be the same in two lanes. What is left is
1163	 * everything the two lanes must agree on, including the settled state of the
1164	 * worker at each checkpoint, what the store held, and what the browser resolved
