1514	/**
1515	 * Leg (c): starting and stopping a task's timer through the header play button.
1516	 * The anchor is the icon flip on that control — a different icon after the timer
1517	 * starts than before, and the before-icon back again after it stops — plus the
1518	 * current task the start sets and the stop clears. The dropped play-indicator
